 =?UTF-8?q?--=20the=20WPF=20Toolbox:=20new=20components=20with=20the=20gen?=
 =?UTF-8?q?erator's=20markup=20(0.21.0)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A new view 工具箱 in the HT9045 side bar: Label, SpeedButton, Edit, CheckBox,
ComboBox, Panel, GroupBox. A click adds one (also: right-click > 新增元件…,
and the command palette):
- into the selected TPanel / TGroupBox / TTabSheet / the form, at 8,8 --
  16 px further down-right while that place is taken by another new one;
- else just below the selected component, next to it in the source (so in
  the same tab sheet / group box);
- named like the BCB6 designer does: Label1, SpeedButton1 ... (the first
  name the page does not use yet); selected afterwards, one Ctrl+Z.
- lib/toolbox.js: the templates are the markup _gen_dfm_abs.py writes for
  each class (<span class="lb">, <button class="btn3d">, <span pos><input
  class="ed">, <label class="ckb">, <select class="ed">, <div class="pnl">
  <span class="pnlCap">, <fieldset class="gbx"><legend><div class="cli">),
  so a new one looks and behaves like the generated ones.

Tests: lib 116 (7 templates: one balanced element each, id, title
"name : TClass", left/top; the first free name), smoke 82 (the view's 7 items
run toolboxAdd; SpeedButton1 into Panel2 at 8,8, SpeedButton2 16 px on; a
label right after spbSave), real VS Code 82 (a new label drawn inside Panel2
per the tree, selected; one undo removes it), probe, panels -- all pass;
opened files MD5-unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
